e; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VkO1Hv74rug?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>AFF Cat E1 Skydive</title><link>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affe1/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affe1/</guid><description>&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YI0U7DKRpH8?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is my AFF Cat E1 jump at Skydive Sebastian. I did two barrel rolls, got unstable and recovered, and high-fived Scooby at 8,000 feet.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AFF Cat D1 Skydive</title><link>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affd1/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affd1/</guid><description>&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/RKQZDTFd37U?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is my AFF Cat D1 jump at Skydive Sebastian with Scooby.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AFF Cat C2 Skydive</title><link>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affc2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affc2/</guid><description>&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uortCdVgQYE?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is my AFF Cat C2 jump at Skydive Sebastian with Scooby.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AFF Wind Tunnel Training</title><link>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affblock1/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://perilune.space/skydiving/affblock1/</guid><description>&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OZCIfRhcbOI?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is my first 12 minute block at iFly; I had 11 minutes in the tunnel before. I did turns, practice pulls, moving forward and back, and adjusting fall rate.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3rd Tandem Skydive</title><link>https://perilune.space/skydiving/3rdskydive/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://perilune.space/skydiving/3rdskydive/</guid><description>&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SFhctPP8b2g?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is my most recent tandem jump at Skydive Sebastian. Before this jump, I did 5 minutes of tunnel at iFly Orlando. It was a lot of fun, but I had a lot of trouble keeping my legs straight and staying stable. Everyone at the dropzone wants me to start working on a license, but I&amp;rsquo;m not comfortable starting AFF until I get really good at tunnel; my big fear is getting into a spin or stuck on my back.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>